          "kind": "MCQ",
          "points": 0.2,
          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>To drop a DEFAULT constraint, use the following SQL:</p><pre><code class=\"language-sql\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ALTER TABLE</span> Persons\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ALTER</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">COLUMN</span> City <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">DROP</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">DEFAULT</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Để xóa một ràng buộc DEFAULT, dùng câu lệnh SQL nào sau đây:</p><pre><code class=\"language-sql\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ALTER TABLE</span> Persons\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ALTER</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">COLUMN</span> City <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">DROP</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">DEFAULT</span></code></pre></div>",
          "imageUrl": "https://media.cuongthai.com/images/exam-questions/DBI202/D16/q42.png",
